From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: GDmio <zhalin66@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 09:53:34 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] BlueOS: DeskClock: Widgets 0.6.1

- The halo clock centers its time in whatever size it is stretched to,
  like the stock clock (it stuck to the left edge).
- Cards keep an 8 dp margin inside their cells; the alarm widget uses the
  normal card with the accent on the icon.

Change-Id: Ib9704b1c0572bc59e27af60af04ce46a78afe91f
